        "original_id": "6ba5614c-6793-5f87-b8b5-187c2c433bdb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Xingcheng, Linzhou, Henan, Liaoning province, Liaodong Bay, Bohai Sea, Huludao, China\n- Organizations: Liaoning Finance and Trade College, Shenyang Shifan University Bohai College\n- People: Wan Da\n\nFacts:\n- Xingcheng, formerly named Ningyuan, is a county-level city in southwest Liaoning province, China.\n- Xingcheng is located on Liaodong Bay on the northern coast of the Bohai Sea and has approximately 140,000 urban inhabitants.\n- Linzhou, Henan covers 2,046 square kilometers and has a population of about one million.\n- Wan Da was born in Linzhou, Henan.\n- Liaoning Finance and Trade College was formerly known as Shenyang Shifan University Bohai College.\n- Liaoning Finance and Trade College is a small, partially walled private undergraduate college in Xingcheng on Liaodong Bay, southwest of Huludao in Liaoning province, China.",
